{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">肥媽曾在節目《暖DD．食平D》中教整「子薑豬頸肉」。這道菜做法一點也不難，而且子薑能完美中和豬頸肉的油膩感，食落酸酸甜甜，非常開胃，絕對是一道極佳的家常菜選擇！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8305364c-6b8b-48d9-8d12-fa0c0bc5a7d2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026cnnzDOYJso1788232157.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8305364c-6b8b-48d9-8d12-fa0c0bc5a7d2.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">子薑豬頸肉材料</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">豬頸肉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">子薑</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">子薑豬頸肉做法</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">切子薑：將子薑切成小塊備用。</p></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"649d0c7d-25fd-4738-bd38-17634ef6d320.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026u45fpkbuCH1788232157.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"649d0c7d-25fd-4738-bd38-17634ef6d320.jpg.webp\"/></div></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T01:22:42.291946+00:00"